OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA brief dry
OL,6,Finterlude in the evening with clear
OL,7,Fskies allowing temperatures to drop
OL,8,Fquickly. Rain and cloud then push back
OL,9,Fin overnight. Winds strengthening
OL,10,Fthrough the early hours in the
OL,11,Fsouthwest, bringing possible gales
OL,12,Falong the south coast.
OL,13,
OL,14,CWednesday:FWet and windy with
OL,15,Foutbreaks of heavier rain through much
OL,16,Fof the day, pushing away during the
OL,17,Fafternoon to leave some evening bright
OL,18,Fspells. Strong winds reaching gale at
OL,19,Fcoasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
