OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,6,Fcalmer, bright start to Thursday
OL,7,Fbefore Storm Austen arrives by evening
OL,8,Fbringing heavy rain and coastal gales
OL,9,Fthrough much of Friday. Further wind
OL,10,Fand rain arrives later Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
